menu "SD Card Writer"

    config SD_CARD_WRITER_TASK_STACK_SIZE
        int "Writer task stack size"
        default 4096
        range 3072 16384

    config SD_CARD_WRITER_TASK_PRIORITY
        int "Writer task priority"
        default 5
        range 1 24
        help
            SD カードへの書き込みはすべてこの task が行います。書き込み中の
            待ちでほかの処理を止めないよう、UI や Wi-Fi の task より低くしています。
            English: every write to the card runs on this task. Keep it below
            the UI and Wi-Fi tasks so card latency never holds them up.

    config SD_CARD_WRITER_MAX_STREAMS
        int "Maximum open streams"
        default 4
        range 1 16
        help
            同時に開いておける stream の数です。stream ごとに file を1つ開いた
            ままにするので、SD_CARD_STORAGE_MOUNT_MAX_FILES より少なくしてください。
            English: each stream keeps one file open. Keep this below
            SD_CARD_STORAGE_MOUNT_MAX_FILES so ad-hoc file access still has a slot.

    config SD_CARD_WRITER_CHUNK_SIZE
        int "Write chunk size (bytes)"
        default 8192
        range 512 32768
        help
            1回の write() で渡す最大量です。512 の倍数にしてください。大きいほど
            1回の転送でまとめて書けますが、同じ大きさの DMA 用 RAM を使います。
            English: largest single write handed to FATFS, in whole 512-byte
            sectors. Also the size of the writer's DMA-capable staging buffer.

    config SD_CARD_WRITER_TICK_MS
        int "Writer wake interval (ms)"
        default 100
        range 10 1000
        help
            producer からの通知がなくても、この間隔で起きて sync の期限を確認します。
            English: the writer also wakes this often to run interval syncs of
            streams that went quiet.

    config SD_CARD_WRITER_BENCHMARK
        bool "Run a write throughput benchmark at start"
        default n
        help
            writer の起動直後に BENCH.BIN へ一定レートで書き込み、実際に SD へ
            書けた量と取りこぼしをログに出します。確認用で、通常は無効です。
            English: at writer start, writes BENCH.BIN at a fixed rate and logs
            what reached the card and what was dropped. For measurement only.

    config SD_CARD_WRITER_BENCHMARK_RATE_KBPS
        int "Benchmark rate (KB/s)"
        default 100
        range 1 4096
        depends on SD_CARD_WRITER_BENCHMARK

    config SD_CARD_WRITER_BENCHMARK_SECONDS
        int "Benchmark duration (s)"
        default 30
        range 1 3600
        depends on SD_CARD_WRITER_BENCHMARK

    config SD_CARD_WRITER_BENCHMARK_BUFFER_KB
        int "Benchmark stream buffer (KB)"
        default 32
        range 4 128
        depends on SD_CARD_WRITER_BENCHMARK

    config SD_CARD_WRITER_BENCHMARK_BLOCK_BYTES
        int "Benchmark record size (bytes)"
        default 1024
        range 16 16384
        depends on SD_CARD_WRITER_BENCHMARK

endmenu
